  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Occupying the entire top floor of a tightly held Tamaki Drive address, this 170sqm (approx) residence presents a rare opportunity to secure elevated waterfront living with views that never lose their appeal.\r\n\r\nFrom Kohimarama Beach to Rangitoto Island and across the Hauraki Gulf, the outlook is exceptional. Full-height double glazing draws the sea and sky into the living spaces, while the balcony provides a front-row seat to Auckland's ever-changing coastal landscape.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan living and dining area is generous in scale, complemented by a contemporary kitchen designed for both entertaining and everyday living. Three well-proportioned bedrooms provide flexibility for families, professionals or those seeking a spacious lock-and-leave retreat. The master bedroom includes an ensuite, with a full family bathroom completing the accommodation.\r\n\r\nPrivacy is a defining feature. With lift access directly to the front door and the entire floor dedicated to one residence, the sense of space and separation is rarely found in apartment living.\r\n\r\nThe location delivers equally well. Step out for a morning swim, enjoy coffee by the water or explore the nearby cafes and eateries. With the waterfront on your doorstep, the best of this sought-after bayside setting becomes part of your everyday routine.\r\n\r\nSolidly constructed and held on a cross-lease title, the property also offers the advantage of no body corporate fees, providing an appealing alternative to conventional apartment ownership.\r\n\r\nFor those who value space, privacy, sun and uninterrupted sea views, this is a compelling opportunity to secure a distinctive waterfront home in one of Auckland's most desirable positions.\r\n\r\nExperience the outlook and the lifestyle for yourself. \r\n\r\n--\r\n\r\nRichard Thode has established himself as one of the outstanding performers within Ray White, both in New Zealand and internationally. Carey Smith, Joint Chairman of the Ray White Group, says \"His results are exceptional, but what has impressed me most is the consistency, drive and professionalism behind those results. Richard combines strong commercial instincts and outstanding negotiation skills with a genuine commitment to his clients. As Ray White's number one salesperson in New Zealand and one of our leading performers internationally, Richard has demonstrated an ability to perform at the very highest level year after year. I have no hesitation in recommending Richard to clients considering selling their property.\"",
